				<h3 id="promobar-content-3">Sign up today for a Job Bank Plus account to make applying easier</h3>
				<p class="description">Apply in one click and get matched with employers with a Job Bank Plus account. Sign up for free to customize your preferences, save jobs and track your activity.</p>
